  notes: DSMZ 29 uses filter-sterilized 1 M Na2CO3 to adjust the receiving medium
    to pH 6.8–7.1; DSMZ 40 inherits medium 29 with 1% NaCl. No carbonate-stock carrier
    is stated. Water in Solutions A–F and sulfide preparation is not evidence for
    this stock. Starting carbonate hydrate, solvent identity and grade, preparation
    volume, and dissolved-gas amount remain unknown. The pH target belongs to the
    receiving medium, not the stock.
